="820" y="680" width="472" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">2. Reprice; reserve stock; persist pending order</textArea><textArea id="04-checkout_text2" x="820" y="872" width="984" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">3. Create payment order outside DB transaction</textArea><textArea id="04-checkout_text3" x="820" y="1064" width="984" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">4. Provider order ID or unknown outcome</textArea><textArea id="04-checkout_text4" x="820" y="1256" width="472" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">5. Persist payment mapping; unknown -&gt; reconcile</textArea><textArea id="04-checkout_text5" x="308" y="1448" width="472" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">6. Checkout details or 202 pending</textArea><textArea id="04-checkout_text6" x="308" y="1640" width="1496" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">7. Customer completes payment</textArea><textArea id="04-checkout_text7" x="820" y="1832" width="984" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">8. Signed captured-payment webhook</textArea><textArea id="04-checkout_text8" x="820" y="2024" width="472" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">9. Verify signature; persist unique inbox</textArea><textArea id="04-checkout_text9" x="820" y="2216" width="984" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">10. Acknowledge durable receipt</textArea><textArea id="04-checkout_text10" x="1332" y="2408" width="984" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">11. Validate payment binding; paid + outbox transaction</textArea><textArea id="04-checkout_text11" x="2356" y="2600" width="472" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">12. Create fulfillment using stable merchant ID</textArea><textArea id="04-checkout_text12" x="2356" y="2792" width="472" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">13. Accepted / status / ambiguous result</textArea><textArea id="04-checkout_text13" x="1332" y="2984" width="984" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">14. Persist tracking; reconcile; notification outbox</textArea><textArea id="04-checkout_text14" x="308" y="3176" width="472" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">15. Read order, payment and shipment status</textArea><textArea id="04-checkout_text15" x="64" y="3520" width="3072" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">Do not dispatch on browser success alone. Duplicate/out-of-order events cannot repeat effects. Late payment after stock expiry: recheck stock or compensate. Provider timeout: reconcile before retry.</textArea></g></svg>